        "product_summary": "Bold platform profile: A raised sole silhouette and round toe bumper create a fashion-led casual sneaker look.\nCanvas upper with lace-up closure: Flat laces and metal eyelets let the wearer adjust the opening.\nPadded collar and heel pull loop: Visible collar padding and a rear loop support an easy dressing routine.\nRubber outsole: The photographed bottom has a grooved tread pattern; the textile lining complements the canvas upper.\nAssortment options: Black and Off White, EU 35-44. Share your preferred color-size ratio for a wholesale quotation.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
